tegories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"uhV0WlIDnO-UxuMezO2t-g","review_id":"bjGk7BiOVW5mKoC9ugVFgQ","date":"2019-01-11T13:32:56","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9089118242263794,"text_excerpt":"My husband and I ate here a few days ago and liked it a lot. We tried the tortila, croquetas, many different pintxos and loved them all. What really stands out for me are the ingredients. Their jamon was delicious, their fiore sardo was the real thing, and everything was made fresh, with great care and nicely presented. Service was great, friendly, and very competent. We will be back!"},{"business_id":"uhV0WlIDnO-UxuMezO2t-g","review_id":"wpHyPcAW0rLaUCozNRmFeA","date":"2018-10-18T15:09:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8990090489387512,"text_excerpt":"Estano features simple fresh ingredients that are put together in a delightful way and with a tapas/small dish format you can try a variety. I have only stopped in briefly to pick up lunch or buy conservas. I was Leary of trying seafood out of a can (Conservas)..but Spain has mastered the art of preserving seafood in a can/tin. It is leagues away from canned tuna or sardines... My favorite is the Razor Clams in this delicious brine - I am somewhat of an addict to these now. Can't wait to meet up with friends and have some wine and have all the feels of being in a Tapas Bar in Spain after work in the near future!"},{"business_id":"uhV0WlIDnO-UxuMezO2t-g","review_id":"yOkveyhOHBbh7-2pp6K2Pw","date":"2018-10-31T16:42:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8939997553825378,"text_excerpt":"Good Spanish Tapas in the Bywater. We went an enjoyed a wide variety of Tapas and everything was very good. Being a fairly new restaurant, the decor was a little sparse. All the inside seating were high top tables and 2 sofas In the rear. Service was very good and well explained. Hopefully as time passes they will put some Spanish decor and Spanish music ."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"uhV0WlIDnO-UxuMezO2t-g","photo_id":"TVzPoYRKuFulrwqXNV037g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/TVzPoYRKuFulrwqXNV037g.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
